  "configs": [
    {
      "content": {
        "_comment": [
          "Supervised baseline benchmark on the COBRA BCC subset (research use only; CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, non-commercial).",
          "Prerequisites: (1) import the subset with `python -m dermpath.importers.cobra ... --project proj-cobra-bcc-subset`",
          "and let its ingest and QC jobs finish; (2) create and freeze a dataset version of that project whose config",
          "declares \"reference_standard\": \"imported_reference\" (COBRA labels were extracted from pathology reports by a",
          "rule-based method; they are imported reference labels, never expert reads) with a patient-grouped random",
          "split that keeps a test split; the most recently frozen version is used (or set \"dataset_version_id\");",
          "(3) midnight-12k needs WB_MIDNIGHT_WEIGHTS (obtained separately; nothing is downloaded).",
          "Protocol: dev_cv with 5 patient-grouped stratified folds over train + val; threshold (Youden), Platt calibration",
          "and abstention are chosen on out-of-fold predictions; the final model is refitted on the development pool; the",
          "test split is NOT read (test metrics only through a recorded test release of a declared candidate).",
          "Learning curves: nested stratified subsets of the development patients at 25, 50 and 100 % with 3 repeats.",
          "Seeds (pre-declared 2026-10-28, before any multi-seed result): 0, 1, 2 for every encoder x head; the outer folds",
          "depend on the development pool and k only, so they are identical across heads and seeds. Seed repeats measure",
          "optimisation variability on the same patients, not additional independent patients.",
          "Run: cd workbench/api && .venv/bin/python -m dermpath.ml.cli benchmark ../experiments/configs/cobra_supervised_baseline.json"
        ],
        "bootstrap": {
          "min_patients": 10,
          "n_boot": 2000,
          "seed": 20261026
        },
        "dataset": "latest_frozen",
        "description": "Encoder effects (handcrafted-stain-texture-v1 vs midnight-12k) with the head fixed and head effects (meanpool_logreg vs abmil) with the encoder fixed, on out-of-fold predictions of one frozen manifest.",
        "encoders": [
          "handcrafted-stain-texture-v1",
          "midnight-12k"
        ],
        "evaluation_protocol": "dev_cv",
        "execution_mode": "supervised_experiment",
        "head_params": {
          "abmil": {
            "attn_dim": 64,
            "dropout": 0.1,
            "hidden_dim": 128,
            "inner_val_fraction": 0.2,
            "lr": 0.0005,
            "max_epochs": 60,
            "max_instances_per_bag": 256,
            "patience": 10,
            "weight_decay": 0.0001
          },
          "meanpool_logreg": {
            "C": 1.0
          }
        },
        "heads": [
          "meanpool_logreg",
          "abmil"
        ],
        "learning_curve": {
          "fractions": [
            0.25,
            0.5,
            1.0
          ],
          "repeats": 3
        },
        "name": "COBRA supervised baseline benchmark",
        "params": {
          "boot_min_patients": 10,
          "calibration": "platt",
          "class_weight": "balanced",
          "cv_folds": 5,
          "max_patches_per_slide": 256,
          "min_threshold_evidence": 10,
          "min_tissue_fraction": 0.25,
          "n_boot": 2000,
          "precision": "fp32",
          "sampling_seed": 0,
          "sampling_strategy": "spatial",
          "stain_normalization": "none",
          "target_mpp": 0.5,
          "threshold_rule": "youden"
        },
        "project_id": "proj-cobra-bcc-subset",
        "report_path": "experiments/reports/cobra-supervised-baseline.json",
        "seeds": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      "file": "experiments/configs/cobra_supervised_baseline.json",
      "sha256": "e4eaa9fbac98d0b21e3030e274fd350ed5ebe572a54082eb45bb130049ab95d6"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "_comment": [
          "Technical validation of the pixel path on the COBRA BCC subset (real_image_technical: NO label is read).",
          "Prerequisites: (1) the COBRA subset is imported with `python -m dermpath.importers.cobra ... --project",
          "proj-cobra-bcc-subset` and its ingest and QC jobs have finished; (2) a dataset version of that project is",
          "frozen (the most recently frozen version is used; replace \"dataset\" with {\"name\": ..., \"version\": ...} or",
          "\"dataset_version_id\" to pin another); (3) midnight-12k needs its weights directory in WB_MIDNIGHT_WEIGHTS",
          "(obtained separately under the model's licence; nothing is downloaded). Without them the command stops with",
          "encoder_unavailable. COBRA is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: non-commercial research only.",
          "Builds one feature set per encoder with the SAME patch and sampling policy (patch_size follows each encoder's",
          "input size), reports coverage diagnostics and re-extracts a seeded subset to check determinism.",
          "Run: cd workbench/api && .venv/bin/python -m dermpath.ml.cli benchmark ../experiments/configs/cobra_technical_validation.json"
        ],
        "dataset": "latest_frozen",
        "description": "Extraction, coverage, determinism, throughput and memory of handcrafted-stain-texture-v1 and midnight-12k on real COBRA slides. No labels, no heads, no metrics.",
        "encoders": [
          "handcrafted-stain-texture-v1",
          "midnight-12k"
        ],
        "execution_mode": "real_image_technical",
        "heads": [],
        "name": "COBRA subset technical validation",
        "params": {
          "max_patches_per_slide": 256,
          "min_tissue_fraction": 0.25,
          "precision": "fp32",
          "sampling_seed": 0,
          "sampling_strategy": "spatial",
          "stain_normalization": "none",
          "target_mpp": 0.5
        },
        "project_id": "proj-cobra-bcc-subset",
        "report_path": "experiments/reports/cobra-technical-validation.json",
        "technical_validation": {
          "n_slides": 2,
          "seed": 0
        }
      },
      "file": "experiments/configs/cobra_technical_validation.json",
      "sha256": "f1f33eabd5e54ee77ca6e3fd7216d1da30d5931a724dd3fa7547e896000a04b5"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "_comment": [
          "PIPELINE TEST - NOT PATHOLOGY VALIDATION. Exercises the benchmark harness end to end on the fictional",
          "synthetic pipeline-test cohort that `python -m dermpath.seed` creates (project proj-synthetic-cohort).",
          "The synthetic encoder's embeddings carry a label-derived fixture signal by construction (only in",
          "synthetic_pipeline_test, only through ml/fixture.py), so its metrics say nothing about pathology.",
          "Run: cd workbench/api && .venv/bin/python -m dermpath.ml.cli benchmark ../experiments/configs/synthetic_pipeline_benchmark.json"
        ],
        "bootstrap": {
          "min_patients": 10,
          "n_boot": 1000,
          "seed": 20261026
        },
        "dataset": {
          "name": "Synthetic pipeline-test cohort (no images, no histology)"
        },
        "description": "Head effects (meanpool_logreg vs abmil) with the synthetic encoder fixed, dev_cv on the development pool, and a small learning curve. A plumbing test of identities, folds, paired comparisons and reports.",
        "encoders": [
          "synthetic-deterministic-v1"
        ],
        "evaluation_protocol": "dev_cv",
        "execution_mode": "synthetic_pipeline_test",
        "head_params": {
          "abmil": {
            "class_weight": "balanced",
            "inner_val_fraction": 0.2,
            "max_epochs": 30,
            "patience": 6
          },
          "meanpool_logreg": {
            "C": 1.0,
            "class_weight": "balanced"
          }
        },
        "heads": [
          "meanpool_logreg",
          "abmil"
        ],
        "learning_curve": {
          "fractions": [
            0.5,
            1.0
          ],
          "repeats": 2
        },
        "name": "Synthetic pipeline benchmark (PIPELINE TEST)",
        "params": {
          "calibration": "platt",
          "cv_folds": 5,
          "max_patches_per_slide": 32,
          "min_threshold_evidence": 5,
          "n_boot": 500,
          "pixel_mode": "none",
          "sampling_seed": 0,
          "sampling_strategy": "spatial",
          "threshold_rule": "youden"
        },
        "project_id": "proj-synthetic-cohort",
        "report_path": "experiments/reports/synthetic-pipeline-benchmark.json",
        "seeds": [
          0
        ]
      },
      "file": "experiments/configs/synthetic_pipeline_benchmark.json",
      "sha256": "5ffd4644ab534721f3b52304cdd4b3e241b5ffb83de4307932f2a347cd0a64b2"
    }
